## Decisions and Action Items

- **Flowspec Compression Encapsulation:** Joel Halpern will work offline with the authors of draft-ietf-idr-flowspec-traffic-compress-action to specify tunnel mode encapsulation and ensure RFC 8200 compliance.
- **SR Policy Performance Telemetry:** Xiao Min will review overlap with the CATS WG and update the draft to incorporate explicit churn-mitigation mechanisms.
- **AI Fabric Node Identifier:** Zheng Zhang and co-authors will evaluate chair and participant feedback regarding the use of BGP Identifiers or proposing a dedicated AFI instead of using Extended Communities.
- **Attribute Escape / PA-ORF:** Aijun Wang will take feedback from John Scudder, Jeffrey Haas, and others to the mailing list to refine the attribute filtering design outside of the standard ORF framework.

